SC,0006
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790724255
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AThe start-ups hoping to return battery
OL,4,Amaking to the US
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We have requests coming from Spain,
OL,7,FFrance, Germany, The Netherlands," says
OL,8,FDarren Tan, co-founder and chief
OL,9,Fexecutive. "We've shipped the first 100
OL,10,Funits and [expect to ship] 1,000 before
OL,11,Fthe end of the year."
OL,13,FUnigrid's battery is an emerging
OL,14,Ftechnology ` it's a sodium ion, rather
OL,15,Fthan lithium ion device. Sodium ion
OL,16,Fbatteries have got energy storage
OL,17,Fexperts excited because they could end
OL,18,Fup much cheaper to build and operate
OL,19,Fthan lithium ion.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
