OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATaylor Swift dominated the VMAs, but do
OL,4,Amusic videos still matter?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut despite the broadcaster reacting to
OL,7,Fthe changes in viewing habits, its
OL,8,FVideo Music Awards (VMAs) still appear
OL,9,Fto hold power over music A-listers.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
